<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">A WEEK OF GOOD FOOD</view><view class="title">下周菜单</view><view class="notice">家中9餐 · 外食1餐<view>荤菜 {{coverage.meatMeals||0}} / 9餐 · {{coverage.meatKinds||0}} / 3种</view><view>素菜 {{coverage.vegMeals||0}} / 9餐 · {{coverage.vegKinds||0}} / 3种</view><view class="muted">覆盖不足或超出时，可返回点菜调整；不会替你自动加菜。</view></view><picker mode="date" value="{{week}}" bindchange="changeWeek"><view class="field">周起始日期：{{week}} · 点此更换</view></picker><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{plan}}" class="notice">第 {{plan.version}} 版 · {{plan.confirmedVersion===plan.version?'大厨已确认':'等大厨确认'}}<view class="muted">提醒：{{plan.notification}}</view></view><block wx:if="{{loaded}}"><view wx:if="{{!lines.length}}" class="card empty">还没选菜呢<button class="secondary" bindtap="menu">去点菜</button></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{lines}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row between"><text class="heading">{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.count}} 餐</text></view><view class="choice-summary">{{item.spice}} · 每餐 {{item.servings}} 份</view><text class="label">这道菜的小要求</text><input value="{{item.note}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindinput="note" placeholder="比如少辣、不要香菜" maxlength="200" /></view><text class="label">还有什么想吃的？</text><textarea value="{{extra}}" bindinput="extra" placeholder="没有在菜库里找到的，也可以写在这里" maxlength="500" auto-height /><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submitted">{{plan?'提交更新后的菜单':'提交给家里的大厨'}}</button><button wx:if="{{role==='cook' && plan}}" class="secondary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="confirm">收到啦，就照这个准备</button><button wx:if="{{role==='cook'}}" class="secondary" bindtap="subscribe" disabled="{{busy}}">订阅下次菜单提醒</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="history">看看过去的菜单</button><view class="footer">修改后需要重新提交。额外想吃的菜需补齐配方后才能估算采购。</view></block></view>